  "_default_comment": [
    "The final fallthrough is REVIEWER: an unmapped route fails closed to the",
    "most privileged role rather than defaulting open. The two /unmapped/route",
    "entries pin that, so a refactor cannot quietly make unknown paths permissive."
  ]
